---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Design Feedback | Pikes Peak Web Designs"
description: "For clients reviewing a preview link during the build: send your notes in one place so the next round gets it right. Praise, changes, and questions are all welcome."
noindex: true
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><a href="/client-portal/">Client Portal</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Design Feedback</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="section-label">During the build</span>
    <h1>Tell me what you think, <em>so the next round gets it right</em></h1>
    <p>Reviewing a preview link? Use this form to keep every note in one place. Be candid: I'd rather hear "I don't love this" now than after launch.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:720px">
    <div class="contact-form-card">
      <h2 class="form-heading">Your feedback on the preview</h2>
      <p class="form-intro">You don't have to be polite or precise. Plain notes help more than polished ones.</p>

      <form data-web3forms data-redirect="/thank-you/?type=design-feedback" action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST" class="form">
        <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="b6c3454b-f07c-43f7-9070-0e0cb5286f55">
        <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="Design feedback: Pikes Peak Web Designs preview">
        <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="Pikes Peak Design Feedback">
        <input type="checkbox" name="botcheck" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">

        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="businessName">Business name <span class="req">*</span></label>
            <input type="text" id="businessName" name="businessName" required autocomplete="organization">
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="email">Email <span class="req">*</span></label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="reviewedPage">Which preview page did you review?</label>
          <input type="text" id="reviewedPage" name="reviewedPage" placeholder="For example, preview.pikespeak.dev/homepage/ or 'the whole site'">
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="overallImpression">Overall impression? <span class="req">*</span></label>
          <select id="overallImpression" name="overallImpression" required>
            <option value="">Choose one…</option>
            <option value="love-it">Love it, and it's ready to launch</option>
            <option value="close">Close, with a few tweaks</option>
            <option value="mostly-right">Mostly right, but one section needs rethinking</option>
            <option value="not-there-yet">Not there yet, and I'd like to step back and talk</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="whatsWorking">What's working well?</label>
          <textarea id="whatsWorking" name="whatsWorking" rows="4" placeholder="What feels right, what you're excited about, and what your team liked."></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="changes">What needs to change? <span class="req">*</span></label>
          <textarea id="changes" name="changes" rows="8" placeholder="Be specific where you can. Examples:&#10;&#10;- The headline at the top should say 'serving Colorado Springs and Pueblo' instead of just 'Colorado Springs'&#10;- The blue on the Services page feels too dark&#10;- Add our BBB logo next to the credentials&#10;- The team photo on About should be the one from the company picnic&#10;- I don't love how the testimonial section looks" required></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="stakeholders">Anyone else I should hear from?</label>
          <input type="text" id="stakeholders" name="stakeholders" placeholder="For example, 'my wife looked at it and hated the footer' or 'my manager wants to see it Thursday'">
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="questions">Any questions for me?</label>
          <textarea id="questions" name="questions" rows="3" placeholder="Anything you're unsure about or want to understand better."></textarea>
        </div>

        <div id="form-error" role="alert" class="form-error">
          Something went wrong. Please try again, or email me at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-full btn-lg">Send feedback</button>
        <p class="form-hint">I turn revisions around quickly on most business days, and you can have as many rounds as you need at no extra charge.</p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
